            "review_title": "Review at Le Square Epicier Fin",
            "review_text": "bam n\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n1\nSuper Bowl view party\nFeb 2021\nThis place shouldn’t be serving food or drink. The staff is overwhelmed with more then 5 customers. It took me 50 mins to get an iced coffee. After an hour the wait staff came to me and asked what I ordered for breakfast. Are you kidding me? For the prices this establishment charges this is unacceptable. Perhaps they should stick to being an overpriced grocer instead of F & B. Went to Hi Tide after this debacle and was served food and drink within 10 mins.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 8, 2021",
