            "review_text": "🌱🌱🌱\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nNice shop but Worst king cake ever\nJan 2021 • Solo\nNice shop but Worst king cake I ever had \nand god knows how much I had ! 😂\n\nNo taste of almond at all \nAnd strange « glaçage » on the top which became worse when you put it in the oven \n\nThe baker convinced me that it is fresh even if I knew that it was not. Next time I will listen to myself \n\nBut look at this amazing picture 🤣\n\nOn the top of that : its also the most expensive in whole city \n\nG** d**** I wished to enjoy this king cake\n\nPlease change your recipe ❤️☀️\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 20, 2021",
