            "review_title": "Review at Le Square Epicier Fin",
            "review_text": "Tung Le\n6 contributions\n0\nMOST BEAUTIFUL PLACE FOR COFFEE AND DINNER\nMar 2020\nI and my friend was there in March 2020 when we had a tour around district 2. I was impressive by the beautiful of Le Square. The unique architecture with three color house which is black, gold, and silver, there is an old classic car near the front door with green field in the middle. Le Square has great menu with various delicious dishes made by Chef David Thai and his team, they are all valued chef with high skill, great effort and huge passion with food. My favorite dishes is Pizza, they make the best pizza in Thao Dien, especially parma ham pizza. There are also many events at Le Square, they organize all big events of the year with various culture (Vietnamese, French, US,...), many excitement games for kids. I love this place. If you have an opportunity to travel, work and live Ho Chi Minh city, let come to Le Square and enjoy your weekend.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 4, 2020",
